title: '? A planner counts its own plan''s signs honestly.'
pid: f52e0e8a-671e-4e5a-952b-47f63a087e59
body: |2-
  Trial: for the next three plans, Tay records whether it raised the
  tier and why. If it never needs to, the count stands; if it often
  does, Top counts from the plan's decisions instead, at the cost of
  reading them.
